<concept id="git-addon-resolve-conflicts-and-interrupted-operations">
  <title>Resolve Conflicts and Interrupted Operations</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>resolving conflicts</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>interrupted operations</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <conbody>
    <p id="p_git_conflicts_interrupted_overview">Use this section when a pull, merge, rebase, or similar Git operation cannot continue automatically. Resolve file conflicts, track the state of the interrupted operation, and then continue, restart, or abort the operation as needed.</p>
  </conbody>
</concept>
